### =========================================================================
### VEHICLE RENTAL PLATFORM - END-TO-END HTTP TEST SUITE
### Base URL through API Gateway: http://localhost:8080
### =========================================================================

@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Register a New Customer
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "sarah_connor",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "email": "sarah.c@example.com",
  "fullName": "Sarah Connor",
  "role": "ROLE_CUSTOMER"
}

### 2. Login to Authenticate (Retrieve JWT Token)
# @name login
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "sarah_connor",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Save JWT Token variable
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}
@userId = {{login.response.body.userId}}

### 3. Verify / Validate Token
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Create Customer Profile
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "userId": 3,
  "firstName": "Sarah",
  "lastName": "Connor",
  "email": "sarah.c@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+1-555-4321",
  "drivingLicenseNumber": "DL-CA-99887766",
  "address": "42 Cyberdyne Blvd, Los Angeles, CA",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 5. List All Available Vehicles
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/vehicles?status=AVAILABLE

### 6. Filter Vehicles by Category (e.g. ELECTRIC or LUXURY)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/vehicles?category=ELECTRIC

### 7. Add a New Vehicle (Admin Action)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "make": "Porsche",
  "model": "Taycan 4S",
  "category": "ELECTRIC",
  "modelYear": 2024,
  "licensePlate": "CA-POR-911",
  "dailyRate": 150.0,
  "status": "AVAILABLE",
  "location": "Airport Terminal 1",
  "fuelType": "ELECTRIC",
  "transmission": "AUTOMATIC",
  "seatingCapacity": 4,
  "imageUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1614162692292-7ac56d7f7f1e"
}

### 8. Create a Booking Reservation
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "vehicleId": 1,
  "startDate": "2026-10-01",
  "endDate": "2026-10-05",
  "notes": "Flight arriving at 10 AM, need baby seat"
}

### 9. Get Booking by ID
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/bookings/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 10. Process Payment for Booking #1
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/payments/process
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "bookingId": 1,
  "customerId": 1,
  "amount": 340.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "paymentMethod": "CREDIT_CARD"
}

### 11. View Payment History for Booking #1
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/payments/booking/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 12. Check RabbitMQ Notification Logs
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 13. Check Notifications for Customer Email
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/notifications/recipient/john.doe@example.com
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
